    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6946" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναλῠ-τικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>analytical,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιστήμη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1359b10
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεωρία,</span> of mathematical
			analysis, <i><span class="en">
				Papp.
				410.28
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συλλογισμός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>Epict.</u>
					2.3.4
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἀναλυτικά</span>
			<i>principles of analysis,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαιδευσία τῶν ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Metaph.</u>
					1005b4
				</span></i>
			; title of <i><span class="en">
				A.
			</span></i>'s treatises on this subject; so <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κή,
					ἡ,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ammon.
				<u>in APr.</u>
				7.34
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>APo.</u>
					84a8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>dissolvent,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς διακρίσεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					161
				</span></i>
			.</div>
